{"ayah/29-51.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Al-Ankaboot 29:51 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Shin bai ishe su ba cẽwa lalle Mũ, Mun saukar da Littãfin akanka, anã karanta shi a kansu? Lalle a cikin wancan haƙĩƙa akwai rahama da tunãtawa ga mutanen \">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/29-51.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-51.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-51.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/29-51.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/29-51.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/29-51.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/29-51.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/29-51.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/29-51.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/29-51.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/29-51.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/29-51.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/29-51.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/29-51.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/29-51.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/29-51.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/29-51.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Al-Ankaboot 29:51 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Shin bai ishe su ba cẽwa lalle Mũ, Mun saukar da Littãfin akanka, anã karanta shi a kansu? Lalle a cikin wancan haƙĩƙa akwai rahama da tunãtawa ga mutanen \">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Ankaboot\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/29.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 51\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/29-51.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/29.html\">Sura Al-Ankaboot</a> › Aya 51</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Al-Ankaboot 29:51</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿أَوَلَمْ يَكْفِهِمْ أَنَّا أَنزَلْنَا عَلَيْكَ الْكِتَابَ يُتْلَىٰ عَلَيْهِمْ إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَرَحْمَةً وَذِكْرَىٰ لِقَوْمٍ يُؤْمِنُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Shin bai ishe su ba cẽwa lalle Mũ, Mun saukar da Littãfin akanka, anã karanta shi a kansu? Lalle a cikin wancan haƙĩƙa akwai rahama da tunãtawa ga mutanen da ke yin ĩmãni.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فزجر من لم يكتف بالكتاب المنزل.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 19/67</cite></blockquote><h3>Abin da ya ruwaito daga wasu</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم</span> <span class=\"st\">استشهد به</span> «{عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم أنه رأى بيد عمر بن الخطاب شيئا من التوراة فقال: لو كان موسى حيا ثم اتبعتموه وتركتموني لضللتم.} وفي رواية {ما وسعه إلا اتباعي.}»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 17/41</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فأخبر سبحانه أن الكتاب الذي أنزله على رسوله يكفي<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 3/435</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ففيه الحجة والدلالة على أنه من الله، وأن الله سبحانه أرسل به رسوله وفيه بيان ما يوجب لمن اتبعه السعادة، وينجيه من العذاب،<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 3/435</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s29a51\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/29-49.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (29:49)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/29-52.html\">Aya ta gaba (29:52)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/29-52.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Al-Ankaboot 29:52 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Ka ce: &quot;Allah Yã isa shaida a tsakãnĩna da tsakãnĩnku Yanã sane da abin da ke a cikin sammai da ƙasã, kuma waɗanda suka yi ĩmãni da ɗarya kuma suka kãfirta\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Al-Ankaboot 29:52 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Ka ce: &quot;Allah Yã isa shaida a tsakãnĩna da tsakãnĩnku Yanã sane da abin da ke a cikin sammai da ƙasã, kuma waɗanda suka yi ĩmãni da ɗarya kuma suka kãfirta\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Ankaboot\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/29.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 52\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/29-52.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/29.html\">Sura Al-Ankaboot</a> › Aya 52</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Al-Ankaboot 29:52</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿قُلْ كَفَىٰ بِاللَّهِ بَيْنِي وَبَيْنَكُمْ شَهِيدًا يَعْلَمُ مَا فِي السَّمَاوَاتِ وَالْأَرْضِ وَالَّذِينَ آمَنُوا بِالْبَاطِلِ وَكَفَرُوا بِاللَّهِ أُولَٰئِكَ هُمُ الْخَاسِرُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Ka ce: &quot;Allah Yã isa shaida a tsakãnĩna da tsakãnĩnku Yanã sane da abin da ke a cikin sammai da ƙasã, kuma waɗanda suka yi ĩmãni da ɗarya kuma suka kãfirta da Allah, waɗannan sũ nemãsu hasãra.&quot;</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإنه إذا كان عالما بالأشياء كانت شهادته بعلم وقد بين شهادته بالآيات الدالة على صدق الرسول ومنها القرآن<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 14/191</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإذا كان الله سبحانه عالما بجميع الأشياء؛ كانت شهادته أصدق شهادة وأعدلها، فإنها شهادة بعلم تام، محيط بالمشهود به، فيكون الشاهد به أعدل الشهداء وأصدقهم،<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 3/435</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s29a52\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/29-51.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (29:51)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/29-61.html\">Aya ta gaba (29:61)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/29-61.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Al-Ankaboot 29:61 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Lalle idan ka tambaye su: &quot;Wãne ne ya halitta sammai da ƙasã kuma ya hõre rãnã da watã?&quot; Lalle sunã cẽwa Allah ne. TO, yãya ake karkatar da su?\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Al-Ankaboot 29:61 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Lalle idan ka tambaye su: &quot;Wãne ne ya halitta sammai da ƙasã kuma ya hõre rãnã da watã?&quot; Lalle sunã cẽwa Allah ne. TO, yãya ake karkatar da su?\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Ankaboot\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/29.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 61\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/29-61.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/29.html\">Sura Al-Ankaboot</a> › Aya 61</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Al-Ankaboot 29:61</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَلَئِن سَأَلْتَهُم مَّنْ خَلَقَ السَّمَاوَاتِ وَالْأَرْضَ وَسَخَّرَ الشَّمْسَ وَالْقَمَرَ لَيَقُولُنَّ اللَّهُ فَأَنَّىٰ يُؤْفَكُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Lalle idan ka tambaye su: &quot;Wãne ne ya halitta sammai da ƙasã kuma ya hõre rãnã da watã?&quot; Lalle sunã cẽwa Allah ne. TO, yãya ake karkatar da su?</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فالكفار المشركون مقرون أن الله خالق السموات والأرض<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 11/51</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ولكنهم مع هذا مشركون به في ألوهيته بأن يعبدوا معه آلهة أخرى يتخذونها شفعاء أو شركاء؛ أو في ربوبيته بأن يجعلوا غيره رب بعض الكائنات دونه مع اعترافهم بأنه رب ذلك الرب وخالق ذلك الخلق.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 11/51</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s29a61\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/29-52.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (29:52)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/29-64.html\">Aya ta gaba (29:64)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/29-64.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Al-Ankaboot 29:64 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Kuma wannan rãyuwa ta dũniya ba ta zamo ba, fãce abar shagala da wãsã kuma lalle Lãhira tabbas, ita ce rãyuwa, dã sun kasance sunã sani.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/29-64.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-64.html\">\n<link re